  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is :\n\nBy using **BODMAS **rule:\n\nGiven: 92*4*36*13*9 = 104\n\nOption 1)** **÷, -, +, ×\n\nAfter replacing of signs :\n\n⇒ 92 ÷ 4 - 36 + 13 × 9 = 104\n\n⇒ 23 - 36 + 13 × 9 = 104\n\n⇒ 23 - 36 + 117 = 104\n\n⇒ 140 - 36 = 104\n\n⇒ **104 = 104 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) +, -, ÷, ×\n\nAfter replacing of signs :\n\n⇒ 92 + 4 - 36 ÷ 13 × 9 = 104\n\n⇒ 92 + 4 - 2.769 × 9 = 104\n\n⇒ 92 + 4 - 24.9230 = 104\n\n⇒ 96 - 24.9230 = 104\n\n⇒ 71.0769 ≠ 104 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) -, ÷, ×, +\n\nAfter replacing of signs :\n\n⇒ 92 - 4 ÷ 36 × 13 + 9 = 104\n\n⇒ 92 - 0.111 × 13 + 9 = 104\n\n⇒ 92 - 1.444 + 9 = 104\n\n⇒ 101 - 1.444 = 104\n\n⇒ 99.55 ≠ 104 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) ×, +, ÷, -\n\nAfter replacing of signs :\n\n⇒ 92 × 4 + 36 ÷ 13 - 9 = 104\n\n⇒ 92 × 4+ 2.769 - 9 = 104\n\n⇒ 368 + 2.769 - 9 = 104\n\n⇒370.769 - 9 = 104\n\n⇒ 361.769 ≠ 104 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, the correct answer is **\"÷, -, +, ×\".**",
